    "detailed_description": "Break free from the system and set out as Bit to escape from the tyrannic OS. Gaining your freedom, though, might not be as clear-cut as it seems\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/dccbe993b4ab467cfca4626afe094879.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/dccbe993b4ab467cfca4626afe094879.webm?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/dccbe993b4ab467cfca4626afe094879.mp4?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE THE DIGITAL WORLD</h2>Traverse the desktop, delve into the forgotten depths of the recycle bin, be immersed into game worlds (literally!) and more. You\u2019ll overcome frantic challenges, unwind with mini-games and uncover the shrouded secrets of the OS.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/1072f7fbd41bff045d63d473c02d92a9.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/1072f7fbd41bff045d63d473c02d92a9.webm?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DYNAMIC &amp; TIGHT ACTION</h2>Platform your way through hundreds of challenges and puzzles with an expansive moveset and simple-tight controls along with various accessibility options to aid you in your journey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/e18e82910b285b417e16bea3828d341d.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/e18e82910b285b417e16bea3828d341d.webm?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEET THE COLORFUL LOCALS OF THE OS</h2>Stumble into lively towns and cities and meet the colorful locals of the digital world. Some will help you along your journey, others might have more devious motives.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/684f50fe3d02370043734ee837e0340f.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/684f50fe3d02370043734ee837e0340f.apng?t=1753358319\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE CAREFUL WHAT YOU WISH FOR</h2>You\u2019ll need to make several tough decisions along the way that could affect you, the friends you\u2019ve made and even the whole digital world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/ca57946a78c5fa2c9f1589fa20c946e0.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/ca57946a78c5fa2c9f1589fa20c946e0.apng?t=1753358319\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Break free from the system and set out as Bit to escape from the tyrannic OS. Gaining your freedom, though, might not be as clear-cut as it seems\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/dccbe993b4ab467cfca4626afe094879.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/dccbe993b4ab467cfca4626afe094879.webm?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/dccbe993b4ab467cfca4626afe094879.mp4?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE THE DIGITAL WORLD</h2>Traverse the desktop, delve into the forgotten depths of the recycle bin, be immersed into game worlds (literally!) and more. You\u2019ll overcome frantic challenges, unwind with mini-games and uncover the shrouded secrets of the OS.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/1072f7fbd41bff045d63d473c02d92a9.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/1072f7fbd41bff045d63d473c02d92a9.webm?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DYNAMIC &amp; TIGHT ACTION</h2>Platform your way through hundreds of challenges and puzzles with an expansive moveset and simple-tight controls along with various accessibility options to aid you in your journey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/e18e82910b285b417e16bea3828d341d.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/e18e82910b285b417e16bea3828d341d.webm?t=1753358319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MEET THE COLORFUL LOCALS OF THE OS</h2>Stumble into lively towns and cities and meet the colorful locals of the digital world. Some will help you along your journey, others might have more devious motives.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/684f50fe3d02370043734ee837e0340f.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/684f50fe3d02370043734ee837e0340f.apng?t=1753358319\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE CAREFUL WHAT YOU WISH FOR</h2>You\u2019ll need to make several tough decisions along the way that could affect you, the friends you\u2019ve made and even the whole digital world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/ca57946a78c5fa2c9f1589fa20c946e0.poster.avif?t=1753358319\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1724490/extras/ca57946a78c5fa2c9f1589fa20c946e0.apng?t=1753358319\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
